  <item>
    <title>Vol.8 戏剧博主大蓝鲸看剧人专访</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6578511b6396a4645a98ea56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6578511b6396a4645a98ea56</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Dec 2023 12:24:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客我们与大蓝鲸看剧人的主理人史迪仔仔一起做了专访，带大家更深入的了解史迪仔仔有戏剧博主账号想法的开始到现在做出的每一项努力，也让大家能够更多的了解到有关如何成为戏剧博主和做好戏剧博主的一些建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 大蓝鲸看剧人账号构成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 大蓝鲸看剧人的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 大蓝鲸看剧人社群数量大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 大蓝鲸看剧人群活跃度高的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> repo类与资讯类的区分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 资讯来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 仔仔与剧院方和制作方的合作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 戏剧博主的经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 账号未来计划</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫是液体动物呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大蓝鲸看剧人主理人——史迪仔仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>【下期预告】</span></p><span></span><p><span>与音乐剧圈未来人脉聊聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>科班与非科班怎么走上这条路</span></p><span></span><p><span>而男性演员与女性演员在这个过程</span></p><span></span><p><span>又有着什么不同的待遇</span></p>]]></description>
