  <item>
    <title>Vol.7 剧院吐槽与戏曲科普</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656f0e99b4b5dd5510bb17d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656f0e99b4b5dd5510bb17d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Dec 2023 11:50:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>剧院本身是安静欣赏戏剧的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>但却总是有观众给他人造成困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客从三个方面</span></p><span></span><p><span>吐槽及分享剧院奇葩事</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时加入戏曲元素</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊一聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏曲和其他剧种</span></p><span></span><p><span>观众的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> &nbsp;嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> &nbsp;与电子设备有关的剧院吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> &nbsp;戏曲拍摄问题的科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> &nbsp;与个人制造有关的剧院吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">44:04</a> 戏曲鼓掌和喝彩方面的科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a> 与个人奇葩行为有关的剧院吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4132">01:08:52</a> 戏曲卡司及打擂台、连台本戏的科普</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫是液体动物呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小陆、琴心、洛泱</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌曲选择】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《他》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《哈姆雷特》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《问山海》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《杨戬》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《轨迹》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《灵魂摆渡之永生》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnA8N3Qv7l48eDDYiy3bH7s2FRN8.m4a" length="124565609" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1a3pmTXBHZTVPUEZ2aU1JMHBxakJNX1RzYjkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
