  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 畅聊与入门舞剧的选择</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6565d2d9f10bbce6353d246e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6565d2d9f10bbce6353d246e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Nov 2023 11:45:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期</span></p><p><span>我们畅聊对舞剧的喜爱</span></p><p><span>同时期待着</span></p><p><span>从没有踏进舞剧现场的各位</span></p><p><span>能够理解并共同爱上</span></p><p><span>这一美妙的艺术表达形式</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 大家选择舞剧的理由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 有关舞剧“门槛”问题的探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> 入门舞剧推荐</span></p><p></p><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><p><span>猫是液体动物呢</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>销金、东流去</span></p><p></p><p><span>【歌曲选择】</span></p><p><span>舞剧《只此青绿》</span></p><p><span>《听雨》一幕配乐</span></p><p><span>舞剧《红楼梦》</span></p><p><span>《游园》一幕配乐</span></p><p><span>舞剧《朱鹮》</span></p><p><span>《人与鹮之舞》</span></p><p><span>舞剧《永不消逝的电波》</span></p><p><span>开场配乐</span></p><p></p><p><span>【下期预告】</span></p><p><span>剧场虽然总是能够给我们</span></p><p><span>带来感动</span></p><p><span>但在剧场内遇到的</span></p><p><span>不文明现象却也格外的</span></p><p><span>影响着我们的心情</span></p><p><span>下次播客我们将开展大吐槽</span></p><p><span>把自己在剧场的奇葩遭遇</span></p><p><span>一吐为快！</span></p>]]></description>
