  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 由小说、影视剧改编的音乐剧、话剧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655c8b7a9f440f5443813525</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655c8b7a9f440f5443813525</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Nov 2023 10:50:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期，众多音乐剧制作公司</span></p><span></span><p><span>越来越多的从国外原版音乐剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及小说、影视剧中</span></p><span></span><p><span>汲取剧本与灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span>那在现在的市场环境下</span></p><span></span><p><span>观众们觉得改编剧质量如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span>而中国原创音乐剧又该</span></p><span></span><p><span>走向什么新的方向？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫是液体动物呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>夭夭、末末</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌曲选择】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《孤独的山巅》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《嫌疑人X的献身》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《看见》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《猎罪图鉴》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《委屈》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《隐秘的角落》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《雨夜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《沉默的真相》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【下期预告】</span></p><span></span><p><span>近期，时隔两年</span></p><span></span><p><span>舞剧永不消逝的电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>又官宣回到了南京演出</span></p><span></span><p><span>舞剧市场在近几年的火热和出圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家也是有目共睹</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏剧女孩第六期将为大家带来舞剧专题</span></p>]]></description>
