    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期南京看剧人戏剧集市圆满落幕</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们和戏剧摊主们一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊看剧人们做周边、物料</span></p><span></span><p><span>都有什么不一样的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫是液体动物呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>塔格利特_、七一、晚安安</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌曲选择】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《夜幕降临的时刻》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《人间失格》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《坠入大海的尘埃》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《人间失格》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《生与死》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《人间失格》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《虚构之春》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——音乐剧《人间失格》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【下期预告】</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着戏剧市场越发的火热</span></p><span></span><p><span>由影视剧、电影、小说改编而来的</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐剧、话剧项目也越来越多</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将从各个方面一起探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span>韭菜们会有何新的感受</span></p>]]></description>
